<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">currency_exchange</span>
</span>
<div class="min-w-0">
<p class="font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface leading-tight text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold truncate">Thu cũ giá ngon</p>
