          Xiaomi Official
        </span>
<span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-canvas text-body-medium font-body-medium text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-badge-discount-bg hover:text-badge-discount-text transition-colors cursor-pointer">
          ASUS ROG &amp; Zenbook
        </span>
<span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-canvas text-body-medium font-body-medium text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-badge-discount-bg hover:text-badge-discount-text transition-colors cursor-pointer">
          Sony Sound Studio
