<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-surface-card text-text-muted hover:text-on-surface font-badge-label text-badge-label cursor-pointer">Apple</span>
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-surface-card text-text-muted hover:text-on-surface font-badge-label text-badge-label cursor-pointer">Samsung</span>
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-surface-card text-text-muted hover:text-on-surface font-badge-label text-badge-label cursor-pointer">Xiaomi</span>
